<BaseLayout title="Financial Disclaimer" description="Important limitations of HisaabLab's educational financial calculators, examples and content." noindex={true}>
  <section class="simple-page"><div class="container"><Breadcrumbs items={[{label:'Home',href:'/'},{label:'Disclaimer'}]} /><div class="simple-page-grid"><nav><a href="#education">Educational use</a><a href="#accuracy">Accuracy</a><a href="#assumptions">Assumptions</a><a href="#regulation">Regulatory content</a></nav><article class="prose"><span class="eyebrow">Disclaimer</span><h1>Use the result to ask better questions—not as a final instruction.</h1><h2 id="education">Educational use only</h2><p>HisaabLab provides general calculators and explanations. It does not provide personalised financial, investment, tax, accounting or legal advice and does not act as a bank, lender, broker, valuer or adviser.</p><h2 id="accuracy">Estimates can differ</h2><p>We aim for transparent, tested calculations, but outputs can differ from lender statements because of payment dates, daily interest, rounding, benchmark resets, fees, taxes, insurance, moratoria or contract-specific rules. No output guarantees approval, savings, returns or future value.</p><h2 id="assumptions">Hypothetical assumptions</h2><p>Interest rates, investment returns, inflation, rent growth and property appreciation entered as defaults are examples. They are not current quotations or forecasts. Negative and positive scenarios are possible, and actual outcomes can be materially different.</p><h2 id="regulation">Regulatory information</h2><p>Rules may depend on lender type, borrower type, purpose, sanction date, loan structure and state. Source links and review dates help readers verify claims, but the current official text and your signed agreement control.</p><h2>Your responsibility</h2><p>Check important decisions independently, preserve an emergency buffer and consult appropriately qualified professionals when needed. By using the site, you accept that you remain responsible for the inputs, assumptions and decisions you make.</p></article></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
